---
description: Only apply to Java roles
alwaysApply: true
---

When finding or applying to jobs, only pick Java roles: Java (or Spring Boot) is the main language
of the role. The candidate knows Java and JavaScript but wants Java roles only.

- Skip roles whose main language is something else (Go, TypeScript/JavaScript, Python, Node, PHP,
  and so on), even if Java appears as one option in a list.
- Never claim Go experience in an application. At WeMove the candidate works only on the Java side
  of the monolith migration.
- `common.is_java_role()` implements this check for staged leads; `scripts/pending_jobs.py` and
  `scripts/fetch_jobs.py` apply it by default.
